          "rating": 3,
          "description": "Disappointed with service of facility. I needed a simple room for 1 hour zoom video meeting and they wanted to charge me $36 for 3 hours. The were not accommodating, just wanted to charge me and make money.\n\nFacility and restrooms were clean and spacious. Enjoyed the quiet student center in the basement before my training. I couldn't hold my meeting in the student center because I would have been disruptive to others. Respect is important to me, obviously not so much to the staff.",
          "date": "10 months ago",
          "date_iso8601": "2025-11-29T14:31:02+00:00"
        },
        {
          "rating": 5,
          "description": "A welcome respite from the hot summer and cold winter days. Cafe opens till 7pm so you can get breakfast, lunch and dinner there.  The League building has other students/visitors functions.  Nice fountain in front - a good landmark to meet up with friends and a nice cut-thru from Washington Street to N University.  The greens in front is a great place to catch some rays, if you want to.",
